{
  "$comment": [
    "靶机目录。exe 不再写死个人目录（C:\\Users\\<某人>\\... 换台机器就废），",
    "改为按平台给候选：写 auto-detect 表示由 scripts/launch-target.mjs 按平台默认安装位置探测。",
    "真机上软件装在非默认位置时，由 Agent 经 app.connect 的 appPath 直接给路径。",
    "launchScript 统一为 Node 脚本，Windows/macOS/Linux 走同一份代码。"
  ],
  "targets": [
    {
      "name": "codebuddy",
      "label": "CodeBuddy CN",
      "port": 9222,
      "platforms": {
        "win32": { "exe": "auto-detect", "launchScript": "scripts/launch-target.mjs" },
        "darwin": { "exe": "auto-detect", "launchScript": "scripts/launch-target.mjs" },
        "linux": { "exe": "auto-detect", "launchScript": "scripts/launch-target.mjs" }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "workbuddy",
      "label": "WorkBuddy",
      "port": 9233,
      "platforms": {
        "win32": { "exe": "auto-detect", "launchScript": "scripts/launch-target.mjs" },
        "darwin": { "exe": "auto-detect", "launchScript": "scripts/launch-target.mjs" },
        "linux": { "exe": "auto-detect", "launchScript": "scripts/launch-target.mjs" }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "vscode",
      "label": "Visual Studio Code",
      "port": 9244,
      "liveEnv": "VSCODE_LIVE",
      "platforms": {
        "win32": { "exe": "auto-detect", "launchScript": "scripts/launch-target.mjs" },
        "darwin": { "exe": "auto-detect", "launchScript": "scripts/launch-target.mjs" },
        "linux": { "exe": "auto-detect", "launchScript": "scripts/launch-target.mjs" }
      }
    },
    {
      "$comment": [
        "Chrome：本平台不止能测 Electron，也能测任意网页。",
        "CDP 是浏览器通用协议，Chrome 的 --remote-debugging-port 与 Electron 完全同源，",
        "connectOverCDP 连两者走的是同一条路，故复用同一套启动器与适配器。",
        "装在非默认位置时，用 app.connect 的 appPath 直接给 chrome.exe 的完整路径。"
      ],
      "name": "chrome",
      "label": "Google Chrome",
      "port": 9255,
      "liveEnv": "WEBPAGE_LIVE",
      "platforms": {
        "win32": { "exe": "auto-detect", "launchScript": "scripts/launch-target.mjs" },
        "darwin": { "exe": "auto-detect", "launchScript": "scripts/launch-target.mjs" },
        "linux": { "exe": "auto-detect", "launchScript": "scripts/launch-target.mjs" }
      }
    }
  ]
}
